 "note": "Yahoo-era league history that lived nowhere until 2026-11-16.\n\nRead by hand off Yahoo's own pages, signed in as T.J., on 2026-11-16:\n  ACTIVITY  football.fantasysports.yahoo.com/{year}/f1/{id}/teams  (the Managers\n            page) - waiver priority, moves, trades and, from 2014, FAAB budget left.\n  SETTINGS  the same league's home page, Commish Updates, expanded via Show More.\n\nTwo limits, stated rather than hidden:\n  * Yahoo labels the settings box \"no RECENT commissioner changes\" when empty, so an\n    empty season (2015, 2019) may mean the log aged out, not that nothing changed.\n    Treat SETTINGS as what Yahoo still shows, not as a complete history.\n  * 2014's log is nothing but Money Paid / Money Owed rows for the $50 buy-in. Those\n    are other people's financial details and the site is a public URL, so they are\n    deliberately NOT here. Only the buy-in amount itself is recorded, as a league fact.\n\nRows are keyed by Yahoo TEAM NAME, which is unique within a season. The build joins\nthem to handles through history.json's team_names, the same way the vetoed trades do.\n\nRun this file to regenerate _yahoo_league_history.json."
}
